      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name} So my main world did, but I've been switching everything over to SmartObjectSync instead as that doesn't exhibit the same problem, as I can't leave the world in this broken/crasher state. I will check if one of my old separate test uploads also exhibits this, if not, I'll see about reverting enough objects to VRC Sync and uploading that as a separate world.",
